{"version":1,"content":"<p>ViuTV昨天（21日）舉行2027節目巡禮，介紹明年6部重點劇集和13個綜藝節目，包括盧瀚霆（AL）與蘇雅琳（Ivy）主演的《金秘書為何那樣》，該劇有不少老戲骨演出，包括前港姐冠軍林鈺洧的爸爸﹑65歲的林俊賢，林俊賢在該劇演AL父親，亦和劇中太太童愛玲有不少對手戲，呂頌賢則演Ivy So父親。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T11:41:27.273819+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:24:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.990837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:37:43.450035+00:00","content_hash":"5284e7bb594307d38edf8e6f7c43635129b49d43211873e0e0cbf2573e764497","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}